<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM load factor up in August.</title>
<headline>KLM load factor up in August.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional traffic and load factor figures from KLM Royal Dutch Airlines (millions of tonne-kilometres unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>			     Aug 1996   Aug 95  Apr-Aug 96  Apr-Aug 95</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p> Traffic		   776.9     714.5     3,585.3    3,367.4</p>
<p> Capacity		1,048.2     971.3     4,989.7    4,607.1</p>
<p> Load factor (pct)	74.1	73.6	  71.9	 73.1</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p> Passenger kilometres4,779.6   4,401.1    21,192.6   19,466.0</p>
<p> Seat kilometres     5,864.9   5,405.2    27,721.2   25,489.8</p>
<p> Load factor (pct)	81.5	81.4	  76.4	 76.4</p>
<p>FREIGHT TRAFFIC</p>
<p> Traffic		   333.0     304.8     1,598.6    1,541.2</p>
<p> Capacity		  506.5     472.9     2,487.3    2,313.0</p>
<p> Load factor (pct)	65.8	64.5	  64.3	 66.6</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
